rk-evidence,\n.mark-method,\n.mark-green {\n  padding-bottom: 1px;\n}\n.mark-point {\n  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 61%, rgba(238, 133, 142, 0.58) 61%, rgba(238, 133, 142, 0.58) 91%, transparent 91%);\n}\n.mark-evidence {\n  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 61%, rgba(236, 166, 121, 0.55) 61%, rgba(236, 166, 121, 0.55) 91%, transparent 91%);\n}\n.mark-method {\n  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 61%, rgba(61, 204, 199, 0.48) 61%, rgba(61, 204, 199, 0.48) 91%, transparent 91%);\n}\n.mark-green {\n  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 61%, rgba(82, 191, 151, 0.48) 61%, rgba(82, 191, 151, 0.48) 91%, transparent 91%);\n}\n.sidebar {\n  height: 604px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  border-left: 2px solid #b01d28;\n  font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n}\n.topic {\n  height: 33px;\n  padding: 4px 4px 2px 5px;\n  border-bottom: 2px solid #b01d28;\n  color: #b2131d;\n  background: rgba(255, 222, 73, 0.5);\n  font-family: \"SimHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.notes {\n  padding: 8px 5px 0 6px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  line-height: 18px;\n}\n.summary {\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n.note-block {\n  margin: 0 0 7px 0;\n}\n.note-heading {\n  margin-bottom: 1px;\n}\n.note-num {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  width: 12px;\n  height: 13px;\n  margin-right: 2px;\n  vertical-align: -1px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: center;\n  border-radius: 2px;\n  color: #fff;\n  background: #08a9c8;\n  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 9px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 13px;\n}\n.note-text {\n  padding-left: 0;\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <header class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"logo-grid\" aria-label=\"申论积累\">\n      <span>申</span><span>论</span>\n      <span>积</span><span>累</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"brand\">\n      <span class=\"brand-name\">人民日报</span>\n      <span class=\"brand-date\">7.24文章精选</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"legend\">\n      <div class=\"legend-row\"><span>论点</span><span class=\"swatch point\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"legend-row\"><span>论据</span><span class=\"swatch evidence\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"legend-row\"><span>对策</span><span class=\"swatch method\"></span></div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"headline-row\">\n    <div class=\"headline\">涵养“自找苦吃”的精气神</div>\n    <div class=\"headline-spacer\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-grid\">\n    <main class=\"article\">\n      <section class=\"paragraph\">\n        <div class=\"article-line first-line\"><span class=\"num\">1</span>苦难成就辉煌，困难磨砺青春。“你们在信中说，走进乡土中</div>\n        <div class=\"article-line\">国深处，才深刻理解什么是实事求是、怎么去联系群众，青年人就要</div>\n        <div class=\"article-line\">“自找苦吃”，说得很好。”不久前，习近平给中国农业大学科技小院</div>\n        <div class=\"article-line\">的同学们回信，充分肯定同学们走进乡土中国深处“自找苦吃”的精</div>\n        <div class=\"article-line\">神，强调“新时代中国青年就应该有这股精气</div>\n        <div class=\"article-line\">神”。</div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"paragraph\">\n        <div class=\"article-line first-line\"><span class=\"num\">2</span>“自找苦吃”就是要敢于挑急难险重的担子，敢于到条件艰苦、</div>\n        <div class=\"article-line\"><span class=\"mark-method\">环境复杂的岗位锻炼，在经历大风大浪、艰难困苦中磨炼意志、增长</span></div>\n        <div class=\"article-line\"><span class=\"mark-method\">才干。青年人要成长成才，就要到更广阔的天地、更复杂的环境中去</span></div>\n        <div class=\"article-line\"><span class=\"mark-green\">历练锻造，多经历一点摔打、挫折、考验，这样才能增益其所不能，</span></div>\n        <div class=\"article-line\"><span class=\"mark-method\">练就担当的宽肩膀、成事的真本领。</span></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"paragraph\">\n        <div class=\"article-line first-line\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"mark-point\">肯吃苦、能吃苦，是一代又一代中国青年茁壮成长的必经之</span></div>\n        <div class=\"article-line\"><span class=\"mark-point\">路。</span>犹记上世纪60年代，300名青年组成突击队，迎难而上、不怕啃</div>\n        <div class=\"article-line\">“硬骨头”，将地势险要、石质坚硬的岩壁凿通，将红旗渠渠线延伸</div>\n        <div class=\"article-line\">了最艰难的616米。进入新时代，无论是逐梦星辰大海的年轻航天队</div>\n        <div class=\"article-line\">伍，还是积极参与支教支边、用脚步丈量祖国大地的青年学生；无论</div>\n        <div class=\"article-line\">是奋战在脱贫攻坚一线、用汗水和赤诚诠释驻村诺言的第一书记，还</div>\n        <div class=\"article-line\">是在边防一线为保卫祖国奉献青春的95后、00后……无数青年不怕</div>\n        <div class=\"article-line\">苦、不畏难，在“自找苦吃”中经风雨、见世面，在热火朝天的社会</div>\n        <div class=\"article-line\">实践中努力书写青春芳华，展现出刚健有为、甘于奉献的精神风貌。</div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"paragraph\">\n        <div class=\"article-line first-line\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"mark-point\">梅花香自苦寒来。青年的时代，选择吃苦也就选择了收获，选择</span></div>\n        <div class=\"article-line\"><span class=\"mark-point\">奉献也就选择了高尚。</span>有驻村第一书记坦言，基层工作艰苦、琐碎，</div>\n        <div class=\"article-line\"><span class=\"mark-method\">但正是在全心全意为人民服务的过程中，自己找到了把所学知识转化</span></div>\n        <div class=\"article-line\"><span class=\"mark-method\">为业务优势的切入点。科技小院的学生们“自找苦吃”——进村“读</span></div>\n        <div class=\"article-line\"><span class=\"mark-method\">研”，为当地村民带来了无数的“甜”，也在摸爬滚打中练就了</span></div>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n      <div class=\"topic\">话题：人生精神</div>\n      <div class=\"notes\">\n        <div class=\"summary\">总论点：青年人就要“自找苦吃”</div>\n\n        <div class=\"note-block\">\n          <div class=\"note-heading\"><span class=\"note-num\">1</span>过渡句</div>\n          <div class=\"note-text\">“自找苦吃”就是要敢于挑<br>急难险重的担子</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"note-block\">\n          <div class=\"note-heading\"><span class=\"note-num\">2</span>对策：就要到更广阔<br>的天地、更复杂的环境中<br>去历练锻造（论述自找苦<br>吃的释义，对策）</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"note-block\">\n          <div class=\"note-heading\"><span class=\"note-num\">1</span>分论点一：</div>\n          <div class=\"note-text\">能吃苦、肯吃苦是代代青<br>年茁壮成长的必经之路</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"note-block\">\n          <div class=\"note-heading\"><span class=\"note-num\">2</span>事例：上世纪60年代：<br>红旗渠青年突击队，新时<br>代航天队伍、支教支边<br>的青年学生、第一书记、<br>戍边战士；无数青年不怕<br>苦、不畏难，在“自找苦<br>吃”中经风雨、见世面</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"note-block\">\n          <div class=\"note-heading\"><span class=\"note-num\">1</span>分论点二：选择吃苦<br>也就选择了收获，选择奉<br>献也就选择了高尚</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"note-block\">\n          <div class=\"note-heading\"><span class=\"note-num\">2</span>事例：驻村第一书记：<br>找到了把所学知识转化为<br>业务优势的切入点；科技<br>小院的学生们：在摸爬滚<br>打中练就了技艺</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
